From: T2 patches for Omarchy contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Keep independent branding and display upstream legal notices

Modified 2026-11-14. Remove upstream wordmarks and add an accessible About
entry displaying each unchanged application LICENSE, author copyrights,
full GPL-3.0-or-later terms and separate dated fork modification notices.

